        "ggQvbAG4KG7_childItem_0": "<p>What&#039;s Included</p>",
        "ggQvbAG4KG7_childItem_1": "<p>DETAILS</p>",
        "ggQvbAG4KG7_childItem_2": "<p>CARE</p>",
        "gg4LiIG13D2_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0306/4076/7108/files/footresttogether.jpg",
        "gg4LiIG13D2_alt": "5 Different IKEA Highchair Footrests Lined Up",
        "gg4LiIG13D2_title": "5 YBG IKEA Highchair Highchair Options",
        "gg_22LlbPjn_childItem_0": "<p>Wooden Footrest</p>",
        "ggQlinjzYqf_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0306/4076/7108/files/yeah-baby-goods-footrest-support-clamps.jpg",
        "ggQlinjzYqf_alt": "White IKEA Highchair Footrest Clamps with Rubber Inside",
        "ggQlinjzYqf_title": "IKEA Highchair Footrest Support Clamps For Extra Stability",
        "gggNUYbXCx0_childItem_0": "<p>2 Support Clamps</p>",
        "ggzeqGDswRz_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0306/4076/7108/files/ikea-highchair-footrest-support-o-rings.jpg",
        "ggzeqGDswRz_alt": "Thick Black IKEA Highchair Footrest O-Rings",
        "ggzeqGDswRz_title": "IKEA Highchair Footrest O-Rings For Double Support",
        "gg4pr2bvKIK_childItem_0": "<p>4 Rubber O-Rings</p>",
        "ggbPg0rYgbc_childItem_0": "<p>Includes sturdy wooden <strong>Footrest,</strong> <strong>2 Support Clamps </strong>with built-in rubber grips and &nbsp;<strong>4 Black O-Rings</strong> for extra stability</p>",
        "ggbPg0rYgbc_childItem_1": "<p>Quick and simple installation - <strong>no tools needed</strong></p>",
        "ggbPg0rYgbc_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Adjust to any height </strong>as baby grows</p>",
        "ggbPg0rYgbc_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Smart, patented design:</strong> Sloped cut-outs on the underside hide support clamps and angle the footrest for ideal 90° positioning&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggbPg0rYgbc_childItem_4": "<p>Easy to clean</p>",
        "ggjJ__igsrU_text": "<p><i>Wood naturally varies in hue, saturation and darkness; therefore, these same variances may occur in our footrests. For this reason, some footrests might not be an exact match with our vinyl leg wraps. Footrests may also have a seam where the color and grain vary.</i></p>",
        "gg6IooVyTsj_text": "<p><i>WARNING: Foot support is important for safe feeding posture. However, footrests inherently make it easier for children to push themselves up and out of the seat. Therefore, the footrest should be used with the child’s safety harness fastened tight. Do not leave your child unattended in the highchair.</i></p>",
        "gg1pAr9c0sw_text": "<p>U.S. Patent No. D964,759</p>",
        "ggwfOJHa3WG_childItem_0": "<p>Wipe clean with wet cloth</p>",
        "gg6cuY_mXe-_childItem_0": "<p>Free US Shipping on Orders $65+</p>",
        "ggf2-Nk_a6-_childItem_0": "<p>Fast, Friendly Customer Support</p>"
      }
    },
